{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33992","headline":"吴中言怀寄南海二同年 · 皮日休","name":"吴中言怀寄南海二同年","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曲水分飞岁已赊，东南爲客各天涯。\n退公秖傍苏劳竹，移宴多随末利花。\n铜鼓夜敲溪上月，布帆晴照海边霞。\n三年谩被鲈鱼累，不得横经侍绦纱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33992.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33992","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}